# Project Structure

- Place app-wide widgets in `lib/widgets/`.
- Place feature-only widgets in `lib/screens/{{feature_name}}/widgets/`.
- Place app-wide models in `lib/data/models/`.
- Place feature-only models in `lib/screens/{{feature_name}}/models/`.
- Keep feature modules under `lib/screens/{{feature_name}}/` with `bloc/`, `models/`, `widgets/`, and `view/`.
- Use `snake_case` for all file names.
- Default to `StatelessWidget` when local mutable state is not required.
- Use additional `StatefulWidget` classes only for clear lifecycle or state boundaries.
